Release notes
This release adds terminal rendering for rux ui specs, see the docs. It also
fixes several bugs in the diff viewer that showed up on very long lines.

• bullet one
• bullet two is long enough that it needs to wrap onto a second line to fit in
  the width
  • nested bullet
1. first
2. second

